&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Docs&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Next.js App Router&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Drops straight into &lt;code&gt;app/&lt;/code&gt; routes&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Distribution&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;npm + optional CLI&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Familiar tooling&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;


  Compared to the alternatives
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I tried to be honest about this on the landing page, and I'll be honest here too:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Zentauri if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You're building with Tailwind v4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want motion-ready components without extra configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want UI + hooks from one package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about TypeScript variant safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use shadcn/ui if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want full ownership and copy-paste into your repo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You're on Tailwind v3 and don't want to migrate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don't need animated overlays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Radix if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You're building a design system from scratch and want unstyled primitives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;


  What's next
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The library is live and published, but it's still early. The things I'm actively working on:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessibility audit and ARIA notes per component&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More components: &lt;code&gt;DatePicker&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Combobox&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;DataTable&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Skeleton&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Storybook integration for isolated component docs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Theming / design token guide for teams who want to brand it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


